`max_element` largest value-er iterator dey. Empty vector hole end iterator dereference kora unsafe, tai age check kore exception deya hoyeche.

```cpp
#include <algorithm>
#include <stdexcept>
#include <vector>

int maximum(const std::vector<int>& values) {
    if (values.empty()) {
        throw std::invalid_argument("values must not be empty");
    }
    return *std::max_element(values.begin(), values.end());
